    "type_designations": ["SJ-LFC", "SJ-WDC"],
    "description": "Single jet rotary vane wheel water meters. Type SJ-WDC has a wet mechanical indicating device; type SJ-LFC has a semi-dry (Liquid Filled Calculator) indicating device with protected registered drums. The meters consist of a brass, bronze or plastic body with connecting threads, an inlet strainer, an optional adjusting screw, an adjusting button plate, a stainless steel shaft with plastic pivot, a rotary vane wheel and gears, and a mechanical indicating device formed by numbered rollers with 5 drums and 4 rotary pointers (for SJ-LFC the drums are installed in a capsule filled with special liquid), a black star wheel with 6 arms for rapid testing, a rubber O-ring, a glass or plastic disc, a rubber gasket and a brass, bronze, steel or plastic head ring with a plastic cover. Optionally equipped with a reed impulse transmitter for remote reading, or pre-equipped for further installation. To be installed in horizontal position only with the indicating device on top."
